	Take your cursed and uncursed potions of water and drop them on a
co-aligned altar, then #pray.  If your god is pleased with you, (s)he will
make them into holy water.

>* how do I rustproof? I know grease temporarily protects weapons from rust,
>but how do you get permanent protection? can you repair rust?  

	You rustproof items in 3.1.x using the same method as in 3.0.x.  That
is; wield or wear the item, then read a scroll of enchant weapon/armor while
confused.  Rustproofing an item also repairs any previous rust damage.

